	(text "Low noise OPA1652 JFET OpAmp\n4.5 nV/√Hz @ 1kHz\n\nunity gain BW: 18 MHz\n114dB open-loop gain\n\nIq = 2mA (max 2.5) per channel "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
